! model
  pc105           Generic 105-key PC (intl.)

! layout
  us              English (US)
  gb              English (UK)
  de              German
  fr              French
  es              Spanish
  ara             Arabic
  ru              Russian
  zz9             Zed Test

! variant
  intl            us: English (US, intl., with dead keys)
  nodeadkeys      de: German (no dead keys)
